There is an exit to the north. Don't worry, it is unblocked. There is an unblocked exit to the south.".
The description of r_91 is "[sweaty scullery part 0]".

The r_90 is mapped south of r_91.
The r_92 is mapped north of r_91.
Understand "upsettingly hot cookery" as r_92.
The internal name of r_92 is "upsettingly hot cookery".
The printed name of r_92 is "-= Upsettingly Hot Cookery =-".
The upsettingly hot cookery part 0 is some text that varies. The upsettingly hot cookery part 0 is "I am sorry to announce that you are now in the upsettingly hot cookery. The room is well lit.



You need an unblocked exit? You should try going north. There is an unguarded exit to the south.".
The description of r_92 is "[upsettingly hot cookery part 0]".

The r_91 is mapped south of r_92.
The r_93 is mapped north of r_92.
Understand "well lit salon" as r_95.
The internal name of r_95 is "well lit salon".
The printed name of r_95 is "-= Well Lit Salon =-".
The well lit salon part 0 is some text that varies. The well lit salon part 0 is "You are in a salon. A well lit one. You decide to just list off a complete list of everything you see in the room, because hey, why not?



There is an unguarded exit to the north. There is an unguarded exit to the south.".
The description of r_95 is "[well lit salon part 0]".

The r_94 is mapped south of r_95.
The r_96 is mapped north of r_95.

The o_0 are object-likes.
The o_0 are privately-named.
